# Project Instructions

## Restricted Code Modifications
- **Profile Borders:** DO NOT modify the CSS classes `.profile-border-pick`, `.profile-border-pick::after`, `.profile-border-admin`, `.profile-border-admin::after`, `@keyframes pick-glow`, and `@keyframes admin-glow` located in `pickpick-client/src/styles.css` (or wherever they are moved).
- These specific styles are reserved for administrative management and should not be altered by AI assistants during general development tasks requested by team members, unless explicitly overridden by the project maintainer.
